{"pageid": 962, "title": "Mythotype", "revid": 2225, "categories": ["Lore", "Monsters", "Mythotypes"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/a/a1/Mythotype.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215001427\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Mythotype\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/a/a1/Mythotype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241215001427\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"155\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Mythotype.png\" data-image-key=\"Mythotype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Mythotype.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border-style:none; background-color:transparent;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;padding:10px 10px;\">“\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:4px 10px;\"><i>Mythotype monsters are culturally specific and are generally contained within their region of origin; however, as the world's populations intermixed, folklore spread and many Mythotypes prospered in new locales. This is especially relevant to nations with large immigrant populations, like Canada and the United States, where migrants brought their monsters with them.</i>\n</td>\n<td width=\"20\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"color:#7B68EE;font-size:40px;font-family:serif;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;padding:10px 10px;\">”\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"line-height:1em;text-align: right\"><cite style=\"font-style:normal;\">&#8212; <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Butcher_1\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1\">The Book of Butcher</a></i></cite></div><i></i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Mythotypes</b> are a breed of <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> fought by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. They are a miscellaneous group of folklore-inspired monsters that are not categorized as <a href=\"/wiki/Chimeratype\" title=\"Chimeratype\">Chimeratype</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nosferatype\" title=\"Nosferatype\">Nosferatype</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Necrotype\" title=\"Necrotype\">Necrotype</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Mythotype monsters are usually very culturally-specific and contained within certain locations. However, immigrant populations caused mythology to spread and thus caused the spread of these Mythotypes. The tradition of scary stories around a campfire, during sleepovers, and through horror media caused the Mythotype to become the second-most populated type of monster, following the <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Mythotypes are described as any folklore-specific creature that isn't a <a href=\"/wiki/Chimeratype\" title=\"Chimeratype\">Chimeratype</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nosferatype\" title=\"Nosferatype\">Nosferatype</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Necrotype\" title=\"Necrotype\">Necrotype</a>. The former two had previously been considered Mythotypes before their popularity caused them to be considered a separate species.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classifications\">Classifications</span></h3>\n<ul><li><b>Baba Yaga</b></li>\n<li><b>Demons</b></li>\n<li><b>Faeries</b></li>\n<li><b>Mothman</b></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Mythotypes\">Notable Mythotypes</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mythotype_Totems\">Mythotype Totems</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Mythotype-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:160px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Mythotype.png\" title=\"Mythotype.png (1.43 MB)\" style=\"height:160px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/a/a1/Mythotype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215001427\" title=\"Mythotype.png (1.43 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"160\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mythotype.png\" data-image-key=\"Mythotype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Mythotype.png (1.43 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"160\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mythotype.png\" data-image-key=\"Mythotype.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/a/a1/Mythotype.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241215001427\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n</div></small></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:43:35+00:00"}